message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "tei--epidoc-crosswalk: TEI/EpiDoc to CIDOC CRM crosswalk for the Linked Open Ogham corpus"
abstract: >-
  Maps OG(H)AM TEI/EpiDoc editions of ogham stones to CIDOC CRM 7.1.3 and CRMtex as RDF,
  with place, keeper, word and reading layers. Axis 1 (structural interoperability) of the
  Linked Open Ogham crosswalk; the weighted belief layer is in tei--epidoc-amt.
type: software
authors:
